      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I would just like to say I avoided a potentially expensive experience , by rejecting Solar Water Wind and their attempts to remove my perfectly ok inverters from my residence, I initially asked this company to remove solar panels from my roof - NOTHING ELSE and they agreed to do this for me, but on arrival at my home it was damn obvious they never intended to do what was asked. The technician stated he had to test my inverters, he then informed me they were faulty and needed repairs followed by I’ll scan your roof panels with my drone - all up they wanted to take my inverters which I refused, so the tech turned them off my system stating they were dangerous. Fortunately I have since had a different company test my inverters and confirm they where fine and the same company removed the panels from my roof as I originally requested, they also checked and turned my solar system back on.The weird part of this is the company that complied with my request stated they were able to identify Solar Water Wind as the previous people I had an unsatisfactory experience with based on the information I provided without naming them.",
